  "boundaries": [
    "Four stable native TCP histories establish same-view current-target retention ACKs; a permit invokes a recorded test callback, not a production peer installation.",
    "Ten halt/SIGKILL cases reuse one native bootstrap/election/publication prelude. No power-loss claim.",
    "The first build failed in test evidence JSON serialization; its logs and raw files remain. Its completed related tests do not make that build successful.",
    "A04 adds two unpublished internal 1.3 wire messages. Existing 45 fixture bytes and schemas, storage kinds and resource bounds are unchanged.",
    "Future publication targets, full owner lifecycle/offline-survivor continuation, cross-view contexts, learner/joint completion and full Phase 3 remain open.",
    "No public runtime enablement, protected CI, push, workflow, cloud run or V5.2 Runner changes."
  ],
